<section class="scenario">
  <blockquote>
    A luxury brand issues an authenticity credential for each handbag. The
    credential moves with the bag through distributors and resale. A buyer
    scans it and confirms — in seconds — that it's genuine and where it came
    from. No central database to breach, no vendor to trust blindly.
  </blockquote>
</section>

